	(lib_symbols)
	(text "This tool is a USB -> RJ45 interface to allow a host machine to inspect\nand control the network for testing purpose. It replaces the \"controller\"\nmodule, but if the controller is on the network it turns into a slave device.\n\nThis device should:\n1. Provide 48V POE through an external power source (not USB)\n2. Allow sniffing the traffic on both RS485 busses\n3. Act as the controller, via USB\n4. Have an RP2040 on-board to perform realtime tasks of the controller\n	- Log inspection\n	- Firmware upgrades\n	- etc"
